FEC recovery latency and tail-risk audit

Existing recovery-latency coverage
The receiver prints fec_recovery_p50_ns, fec_recovery_p99_ns, and fec_recovery_max_ns. It does not print p99.9. Therefore p99.9 is ABSENT in existing logs.

